IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://architecturehousto
 n.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Calendar-3.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://architecturehouston.org/wp-content/upload
 s/2026/07/Calendar-3.jpg
UID:_OJ_6vZnjeKa5X6hnh93b
SUMMARY:Home Tour
DTSTAMP:20260823T033704Z
DTSTART:20261107T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:The AIA Houston Home Tour is a 2-day\, self-guided tour featuri
	ng custom homes in the Houston area designed by licensed architects. \nJoi
	n us to experience some of the best new residential architecture by AIA me
	mbers in a variety of architectural styles\, featuring new construction\, 
	renovations\, and additions. \nLearn more about the tour and preview each 
	home HERE. \nTickets purchased online may be picked up at any one of the f
	eatured homes on the days of the tour. Additionally\, Full-Tour and Single
	 Home Tickets may be purchased at any of the featured homes on the days of
	 the tour. \nThis is a rain or shine event. All sales are final.\n\nhttps:
	//architecturehouston.org/event/hometour/\n\nFrom AIA Houston
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/hometour/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:aia-houston
CATEGORIES:AIA Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT24H
END:VEVENT
